Description: VeltOS Camera, a Windows 11 style camera app
 Takes photos and videos with a webcam in the layout of Windows 11's
 Camera: the picture fills the window, Photo/Video, the shutter and the
 last capture on the right, settings (framing grid, sound with videos,
 save location) and a photo timer on the left. Photos and videos are
 saved in Pictures > Camera Roll.
 .
 The camera is Qt Multimedia's (FFmpeg backend, V4L2 cameras).
